as individuals. Whether your goal is to improve technical ability, boost soccer IQ, or experience what it’s like to train in a top-tier college soccer environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Oregon State University delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09','$449','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university#session-80989-1215655',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T14:59:55.656Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T14:59:57.114Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','46fff6d0-dec9-457f-93e1-851471bfb0da','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-5-9-2026','2026-05-09T14:59:55.656Z','2026-05-09T14:59:55.656Z');

