 brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: “We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.”',6,16,'all','2026-12-21','2026-12-23','$275','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-schaumburg-il#session-85098-1221323',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:00:52.636Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:00:53.532Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','70402c8c-891b-43fd-a738-8d5896a24160','nike-soccer-camp-in-schaumburg-winter-break-dec-21-23-2026','2026-05-09T15:00:52.636Z','2026-05-09T15:00:52.636Z');

