ience from the opening whistle to the final celebration. Hear from Head Coach Brittany Nikolic: "Our coaching staff is made up of current college coaches and college players. We love to teach technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."',6,14,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$245','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside#session-79297-1212839',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:06.864Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:07.291Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','bbeee7db-55b5-4a7a-81e8-d3faba83f0a3','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-wisconsin-parkside-june-15-18-2026','2026-05-09T15:01:06.864Z','2026-05-09T15:01:06.864Z');

