s to compete at the collegiate level while building independence, friendships, and lasting summer memories. Sure to be a summer highlight, this camp offers a unique and exciting opportunity for aspiring soccer players ages 10–16 to train in a FUN, engaging, and collegiate-level setting. Throughout the week, campers will develop new skills, refine techniques, expand their game knowledge, and enjoy the game alongside players from across the region.',10,16,'all','2026-06-07','2026-06-09','$554','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-the-university-of-oklahoma#session-82750-1218097',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:41.801Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:41.999Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','9077d073-e27d-47c2-a0d5-0be9229682af','nike-soccer-camp-in-norman-oklahoma-june-7-9-2026','2026-05-09T15:01:41.801Z','2026-05-09T15:01:41.801Z');

