takes to compete at the collegiate level while building independence, friendships, and lasting summer memories. Sure to be a summer highlight, this camp offers a unique and exciting opportunity for aspiring soccer players ages 10–16 to train in a FUN, engaging, and collegiate-level setting. Throughout the week, campers will develop new skills, refine techniques, expand their game knowledge, and enjoy the game alongside players from across the region.',10,16,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-14','$554','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-the-university-of-oklahoma#session-82751-1218099',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:43.054Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:43.724Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','87554533-3e9e-4700-b841-b53074de9161','nike-soccer-camp-in-norman-oklahoma-july-12-14-2026','2026-05-09T15:01:43.054Z','2026-05-09T15:01:43.054Z');

