 confidence and love for the game through high-level coaching in a fun, competitive environment."',10,18,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-11','$499','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville#session-82282-1217459',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:01:45.809Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:01:46.035Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','22eab365-04f3-49e3-8953-1b66d3701f36','nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville-university-residential-camp-i-june-8-11-2026','2026-05-09T15:01:45.809Z','2026-05-09T15:01:45.809Z');

