ed to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport. We understand the investment families make and strive to deliver a high-quality, impactful camp experience. Giveaways, prizes, and awards will be earned throughout the week, and all campers receive a Marquette Soccer t-shirt.',9,15,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23','$659','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-elite-boys-soccer-camp-marquette-university#session-84570-1220581',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:02:12.113Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:02:12.313Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','6327b487-bfee-4898-8c2d-37a5877af19f','marquette-university-elite-boys-overnight-nike-soccer-camp-july-20-23-2026-bxp6','2026-05-09T15:02:12.113Z','2026-05-09T15:02:12.113Z');

