ce to train like the pros, push your game forward, and experience the intensity and excitement of a true academy-style environment. Whether you''re aiming to elevate your game, build a stronger foundation, or simply enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer, this Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect opportunity to take your skills to the next level.',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31','$375','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-elkins-park#session-83640-1219307',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:03:30.842Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:03:31.046Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','5a993a94-785c-4cd4-9977-613bae66b064','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-elkins-park-day-camp-july-27-31-2026-nlhq','2026-05-09T15:03:30.842Z','2026-05-09T15:03:30.842Z');

