perience that pushes athletes to grow on and off the field. Leave Camp More Confident – Our goal is for every camper to leave with stronger skills, new friendships, and a greater love for the game. Hear From Coach Alan Berrios: “Our youth camps are built around creating a positive and inspiring environment where young players can grow their love for the game while developing strong fundamentals. Every session is run by our coaching staff and supported by current and former NAU players, allowing campers to learn directly from athletes who train and compete at the Division I level. We focus on teaching the game the right way, building technical skills, confidence, teamwork, and character. While making sure players are having fun and feeling supported every step of the way. Our goal is for every camper to leave with improved skills, new friendships, and an even greater passion for soccer.”',6,16,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19','$355','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-northern-arizona-university-flagstaff#session-84630-1220670',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:03:50.490Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:03:50.750Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','2312da3a-d02e-481f-b34f-d7524fec708a','nike-soccer-camp-at-northern-arizona-university-flagstaff-june-15-19-2026-dojx','2026-05-09T15:03:50.490Z','2026-05-09T15:03:50.490Z');

