ds, inspiring coaches, and unforgettable memories, all while taking your game to the next level!',6,16,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$359','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-haverhill-ma#session-84107-1219945',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:05:31.246Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:05:31.529Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','33a27c34-be43-45bd-8ce2-0d0bb12f4dbe','nike-soccer-camp-in-haverhill-june-29-july-3-2026','2026-05-09T15:05:31.246Z','2026-05-09T15:05:31.246Z');

