ccer Camp experience!',10,14,'all','2026-08-11','2026-08-13','$199','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-notre-dame-high-school-nj#session-84672-1220735',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:06:24.142Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:06:25.852Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','ae176555-0272-454e-8945-c71e6f5fa51d','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-notre-dame-high-school-aug-11-13-2026','2026-05-09T15:06:24.142Z','2026-05-09T15:06:24.142Z');

