 to the joy of soccer through movement‑based activities, foundational skill work, and fun‑focused learning. Older players ages 6–14 will enjoy training that blends fast‑paced technical drills, ball‑mastery work, small‑sided games, and competitive match play, all designed to elevate skills and soccer IQ in a fun and engaging setting. Each day is thoughtfully structured to balance high‑tempo development with recovery time, ensuring players stay active, engaged, and motivated while enjoying access to shaded areas throughout the complex. With world‑class fields, exceptional coaching from JM Soccer Academy, and the proven structure of Nike Soccer Camps, this program delivers one of the most exciting and complete soccer experiences in the Reno–Sparks region. Join us this summer at Golden Eagle Sports Complex and take your game to the next level with elite coaching, top‑tier facilities, and nonstop soccer fun!',4,14,'all','2026-07-07','2026-07-10','$355','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-jm-soccer-academy-reno-nv#session-82752-1218102',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:09:10.919Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:09:11.646Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','c6330cc1-d85f-413b-b236-dc009f8240b3','nike-soccer-camp-with-jm-soccer-academy-in-reno-july-7-10-2026-zdz0','2026-05-09T15:09:10.919Z','2026-05-09T15:09:10.919Z');

