, position‑specific coaching, competitive play, and soccer IQ training. Whether athletes are building foundational skills or refining the details needed to advance to the next level, they’ll be challenged, supported, and inspired by coaches who know how to elevate young talent. With elite instruction, a fun and competitive atmosphere, and the stunning facilities of MSU Denver, this camp delivers one of Colorado’s premier youth soccer experiences. Hear from Head Coach and Camp Director Katie Hooker: "MSU Coed Day Camp is designed for soccer players of all levels to have fun while improving their game in a positive, engaging environment. Players are grouped and adjusted throughout camp based on age and ability to ensure the right balance of challenge, support, and development." Join us this summer and train like a Roadrunner as you take your game to the next level!',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12','$485','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-metropolitan-state-denver#session-79682-1213447',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:09:18.897Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 15:11:25','Bulk approve ussportscamps harvester run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:09:20.511Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','cd31c5ef-9132-478c-ab7f-95e6c136f64d','nike-soccer-camp-at-metropolitan-state-university-of-denver-june-8-12-2026-xhbh','2026-05-09T15:09:18.897Z','2026-05-09T15:09:18.897Z');

