ull Day options for players ages 8-18, providing flexibility to suit every camper''s needs. If your campers is a beginner or intermediate level player, please visit: Nike Tennis Camp at Mount Holyoke - All Skills Program This Camp must comply with the regulations of the Massachusetts Department of Public Health and be licensed by the local Board of Health. Parents/Guardians will have the right to review background checks, healthcare and discipline policies, and grievance procedures upon request.',8,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-17','$1049','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/tournament-challenge-camp-massachusetts#session-80331-1214725',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T15:36:28.730Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T15:36:29.328Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','5424e900-2a1a-4376-9c31-bc410bd1b12c','nike-tennis-camp-amherst-at-mount-holyoke-college-tournament-programs-tournament-qi7h','2026-05-09T15:36:28.730Z','2026-05-09T15:36:28.730Z');

