 Utica Unicorns, and the Westside Woolly Mammoths. Sign up today!',7,12,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-05','$325','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-united-states-professional-baseball-league',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:33:47.649Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:33:47.953Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','89e73faf-8d54-4f62-b681-195370e85d3f','nike-baseball-camp-at-uwm-field-directed-by-united-states-professional-baseball-','2026-05-09T18:33:47.649Z','2026-05-09T18:33:47.649Z');

