Instructors will utilize New York Empire Baseball''s proprietary Player Development Platform along with Blast Motion Bat Sensors and high-speed video analysis, among other technologies, to measure, assess, and define unique development programs for every player. This Camp will be rain or shine - as in the event of rain, Camp will move indoors to New York Empire Baseball''s High-Tech indoor home, The Arena. Players will begin their week-long experience with a complete Assessment and Baseline Hitting &amp; Pitching analysis before receiving their personalized Camp training program. All players will then engage in 5 days of small group sessions in Hitting, Throwing, Infielding, Outfielding, Baserunning, and Game Situations. Each day will focus on healthy athletic development and skill acquisition in a fun &amp; engaging environment that will also teach the mental/emotional approach needed to eliminate performance anxiety and fear of failure. Players will develop skills that scale, and receive an individualized post-Camp training routine to continue their own development.',8,18,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19','$1269','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-central-park',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:34:01.156Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:36:46','Bulk approve ussportscamps run',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:34:01.443Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','7cd0fe26-7dec-443a-a7d6-afdb654e989d','nike-baseball-camp-central-park-june-15-19-2026','2026-05-09T18:34:01.156Z','2026-05-09T18:34:01.156Z');

