r own lunch or purchase it on campus. Nike Sports Camp Experience At Boise State University, Nike Sports Camps offers a unique experience with many sports (Baseball, Cross Country, Golf, Soccer, Softball, Swim, Tennis, and Track &amp; Field) operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Complex/Transportation Information Train like the pros in 2026! The Nike Baseball Camp at BSU will now be conducting all baseball training at Memorial Stadium in Garden City—the official home of the Boise Hawks. Campers and staff will be transported by bus between Boise State and the stadium each day. The Nike Baseball Camp at Boise State University is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by Boise State University.',10,17,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$899','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-boise-state-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:40:40.892Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:51:04','Bulk approve ussportscamps full sweep',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:40:41.115Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','e74ee030-22cc-4c24-869a-52485c8e951b','nike-baseball-camp-at-boise-state-university-overnight-camp-june-15-18-2026-n4iz','2026-05-09T18:40:40.892Z','2026-05-09T18:40:40.892Z');

