 Sports Camp Experience At University of Puget Sound, Nike Sports Camps offers a unique experience with many sports (Baseball, Cross Country, Soccer, Softball, Swim, Tennis, and Track &amp; Field) operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Facilities/Transportation The camp utilizes a combination of the University of Puget Sound (Session #1) and Bellarmine Preparatory School’s (Session #2) baseball complexes. For any off-campus training, campers and staff are transported by bus to and from the baseball complex. The 2026 athletic facilities will be confirmed in the spring. The Nike Baseball Camp at University of Puget Sound is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by University of Puget Sound.',8,17,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-30','$499','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-university-of-puget-sound',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T18:40:41.496Z','support@parentcoachdesk.com','2026-05-09 18:51:04','Bulk approve ussportscamps full sweep',NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T18:40:41.886Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','87b50bcc-88ee-448a-8667-490483258481','nike-baseball-camp-at-university-of-puget-sound-day-camp-july-27-30-2026-ie9v','2026-05-09T18:40:41.496Z','2026-05-09T18:40:41.496Z');

