mp enrollment, and reinforcing parents’ confidence that their investment was worthwhile.',10,15,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$728','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/volleyball/nike/nike-volleyball-camp-la-mesa',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T19:35:34.713Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T19:35:35.274Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','c20954be-9b7c-4e4b-a3cc-c099dfe5de1f','nike-volleyball-camp-at-helix-charter-high-school-san-diego-all-skills-camp-june-acox','2026-05-09T19:35:34.713Z','2026-05-09T19:35:34.713Z');

