etes and as individuals. Whether your goal is to improve technical ability, boost soccer IQ, or experience what it’s like to train in a top-tier college soccer environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Oregon State University delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-19','2026-07-23','$449-$919','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:19:22.328Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:19:22.599Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','71408456-cfc9-4f9c-bf41-78e36aa23238','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-19-23-2026-mot2','2026-05-09T20:19:22.328Z','2026-05-09T20:19:22.328Z');

