we knew character development had to be embedded into our program.But it’s not just about building strong individuals; it’s also about ensuring that the game remains fun. Just like with our college players, we make it a priority that every camper understands the joy of soccer. Too often, we see young athletes losing sight of why they fell in love with the game in the first place. At San Francisco Soccer Camp, we create a space where players can work hard, grow technically, and most importantly — have fun. It’s that balance of passion, skill, character, and joy that makes our camp so unique."',9,13,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10','$719','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-san-francisco',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:20:37.922Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:20:38.293Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','6fe6569c-9910-4e42-9adb-e692d1998682','san-francisco-soccer-camp-junior-premier-iv-sold-out-july-6-10-2026','2026-05-09T20:20:37.922Z','2026-05-09T20:20:37.922Z');

