p in your soccer journey!',6,13,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$409-$519','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-university-of-portland',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:20:41.584Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:20:41.825Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','e1ed3b9c-ed80-442a-a245-59793a8e346e','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-university-of-portland-june-15-18-2026','2026-05-09T20:20:41.584Z','2026-05-09T20:20:41.584Z');

