occer camp in Milwaukee provides the perfect balance of high-level coaching and fun, giving players the chance to improve, compete, make friends, and create lasting summer memories. Hear from Men''s Head Coach &amp; Camp Director, David Korn: "Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport."',6,14,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10','$319-$439','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-marquette-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:20:49.540Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:20:49.761Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','b9071a82-c9d3-4e18-a366-a1c120c26336','nike-soccer-camp-at-marquette-university-july-6-10-2026','2026-05-09T20:20:49.540Z','2026-05-09T20:20:49.540Z');

