er journey or looking to sharpen competitive edge, this Nike Soccer Camp delivers a high-level and memorable experience where players grow their game, build confidence, and form lasting friendships.Hear from Rod Lafaurie: "Our goal is simple: we want every player to feel safe, have fun, and love every day they spend with us. By training within a curriculum designed by college soccer coaches and utilizing our elite facilities, from the field to the pool, we create a high-energy environment that challenges players to grow. We pride ourselves on clear communication and a development-focused approach that builds technical skills and character, ensuring your child leaves with a deeper love for the game and the confidence to take their next step in soccer."',6,16,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$345-$465','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-los-angeles-occidental-college',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:20:50.327Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:20:51.927Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','9ec54ccf-9d52-4410-8674-bdd221ed2358','nike-soccer-camp-at-occidental-college-june-29-july-3-2026','2026-05-09T20:20:50.327Z','2026-05-09T20:20:50.327Z');

