 play. Off the field, players enjoy a well-rounded camp experience with evening activities and social events, creating a fun and memorable atmosphere. These activities are hosted in combination with the Nike Volleyball and Basketball camps running concurrently, adding to the energy and community feel across campus—making this one of the standout summer experiences for multi-sport athletes. This camp is not affiliated with Florida International University, its staff, coaches, or athletics program.',8,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-16','$499-$899','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-miami-florida-international-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:21:18.125Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:21:18.494Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','8636b27f-578e-4c4a-a587-403da0145d5b','nike-soccer-camp-at-florida-international-university-july-12-16-2026','2026-05-09T20:21:18.125Z','2026-05-09T20:21:18.125Z');

