. If you’re looking for a fun, safe, and exciting way to spend the summer in Scottsdale, this indoor Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect place to play, learn, and fall in love with the game.',5,14,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$399','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-indoor-soccer-camp-hub-sports-rancho-solano',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:21:19.465Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:21:21.041Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','82263bd1-1382-4b37-bb5b-11a0da597ad5','nike-indoor-soccer-camp-with-hub-sports-at-rancho-solano-prep-school-indoor-camp-moda','2026-05-09T20:21:19.465Z','2026-05-09T20:21:19.465Z');

