t creates a FUN universal learning environment. With a seasoned leadership group and current student athletes embedded within the University of Portland women''s soccer program, we are able to bring out the most in campers regardless of whether they''re new to the game or already committed footballers."',6,13,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-25','$409-$519','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-university-of-portland',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:22:53.752Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:22:55.422Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','b4434b48-e16a-4358-9825-791e0a3c3543','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-university-of-portland-june-22-25-2026','2026-05-09T20:22:53.752Z','2026-05-09T20:22:53.752Z');

