experience from the opening whistle to the final celebration. Hear from Head Coach Brittany Nikolic: "Our coaching staff is made up of current college coaches and college players. We love to teach technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."',6,14,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$245-$335','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:22:56.671Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:22:58.310Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','e68d0100-d9b6-44cc-86bd-103eed467310','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-wisconsin-parkside-june-15-18-2026-arm8','2026-05-09T20:22:56.671Z','2026-05-09T20:22:56.671Z');

