ur skills, prepare for the upcoming season, or simply enjoy a week of high-quality soccer training, the Sacred Heart University Boys Soccer Camp offers the perfect blend of development, competition, and summer fun.',8,18,'all','2026-06-21','2026-06-24','$545-$829','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-sacred-heart-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:22:59.865Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:01.409Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','4dcce2c2-ad7e-4e81-b7b5-39581b6efc61','nike-boys-soccer-camp-sacred-heart-university-june-21-24-2026','2026-05-09T20:22:59.865Z','2026-05-09T20:22:59.865Z');

