lps players grow on and off the field and prepares them to bring what they’ve learned back to their teams.',8,18,'all','2026-05-31','2026-06-04','$439-$739','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-boys-southeastern-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:04.759Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:06.270Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','32f85047-fc96-4539-9b17-e4e9e18571bf','nike-boys-soccer-camp-southeastern-university-may-31-june-4-2026','2026-05-09T20:23:04.759Z','2026-05-09T20:23:04.759Z');

