tions throughout the week. The Nike Soccer Camp at Rider University delivers a well‑rounded summer experience that combines quality coaching, structured training, and an engaging residential setting, helping players improve their game, build confidence, and create lasting memories.',9,16,'all','2026-07-26','2026-07-29','$679-$789','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-rider-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:36.735Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:38.349Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','89ea0d7a-caf1-4d3a-96aa-fe59e9de8ee7','nike-soccer-camp-at-rider-university-july-26-29-2026','2026-05-09T20:23:36.735Z','2026-05-09T20:23:36.735Z');

