 takes to compete at the collegiate level while building independence, friendships, and lasting summer memories. Sure to be a summer highlight, this camp offers a unique and exciting opportunity for aspiring soccer players ages 10–16 to train in a FUN, engaging, and collegiate-level setting. Throughout the week, campers will develop new skills, refine techniques, expand their game knowledge, and enjoy the game alongside players from across the region.',10,16,'all','2026-06-07','2026-06-09','$554-$629','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-the-university-of-oklahoma',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:23:40.887Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:23:42.583Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','b2c3dcde-c15d-44bc-9d7a-26dcf853003c','nike-soccer-camp-in-norman-oklahoma-june-7-9-2026-pfyk','2026-05-09T20:23:40.887Z','2026-05-09T20:23:40.887Z');

