ut in confidence and love for the game through high-level coaching in a fun, competitive environment."',9,17,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-11','$499-$599','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:18.712Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:18.973Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','a9418623-8d6f-492d-a540-6e2394d61720','nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville-university-residential-camp-i-june-8-11-2026-7nj6','2026-05-09T20:24:18.712Z','2026-05-09T20:24:18.712Z');

