s built around the belief that young players learn best when they feel supported, challenged, and excited to be on the field. Through positive coaching, fun and engaging activities, and age-appropriate skill development, players will build confidence, improve their soccer fundamentals, learn teamwork and sportsmanship, and develop a lasting love for the game in a safe and encouraging environment."',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12','$335','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-charles-il',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:32.898Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:33.173Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','a5489402-04f3-45ff-be7f-abcd7f108057','nike-soccer-camp-in-st-charles-june-8-12-2026-ajb0','2026-05-09T20:24:32.898Z','2026-05-09T20:24:32.898Z');

