ene, MACU, Pratt Junior College, Butler Junior College, Seminole State and Cowley College.',13,22,'all','2026-07-25','2026-07-25','$149','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-oklahoma-state-university-girls-id-camp',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:37.893Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:38.143Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','83e55147-4da9-47ee-8bc3-ba1ede95abaf','nike-girls-id-camp-at-oklahoma-state-university-july-25-2026','2026-05-09T20:24:37.893Z','2026-05-09T20:24:37.893Z');

