ance of safety, comfort, and high‑quality training throughout the day. Whether your player is new to the game or preparing for higher‑level competition, this camp offers an unforgettable week filled with learning, excitement, and growth. Coach Luke Sheekey and Joe Ilett will also be running camps at Eckerd College in St. Petersburg! Details can be found HERE',5,14,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-05','$299-$445','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-petersburg-admiral-farragut-academy',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:24:44.894Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:24:46.648Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','5d3b00d7-853c-4daa-a055-c328b58ae033','nike-soccer-camp-at-admiral-farragut-academy-june-1-5-2026','2026-05-09T20:24:44.894Z','2026-05-09T20:24:44.894Z');

