om start to finish. Join us this summer and take your game to the next level with one of the top training experiences in Texas!',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31','$399','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-dallas-college-brookhaven',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:25:28.543Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:25:30.067Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','a24cef50-5e0e-485e-9ac5-021c6a7e4245','nike-soccer-camp-at-dallas-college-brookhaven-july-27-31-2026-inar','2026-05-09T20:25:28.543Z','2026-05-09T20:25:28.543Z');

