tart to finish. Join us this summer and take your game to the next level with one of the top training experiences in Texas!',6,16,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-05','$399','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-dallas-college-northlake',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:25:30.427Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:25:31.982Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','1faff1c7-6070-4fd0-bd49-af17a3eb842d','nike-soccer-camp-at-dallas-college-north-lake-june-1-5-2026-0snd','2026-05-09T20:25:30.427Z','2026-05-09T20:25:30.427Z');

