7-09','2026-07-12','$629-$729','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-seattle-university-collegiate-experience',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:25:46.176Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:25:47.785Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','ab55edcc-da88-4c30-80c7-a37bb5c7697f','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-seattle-university-overnight-collegiate-experience-jul-68py','2026-05-09T20:25:46.176Z','2026-05-09T20:25:46.176Z');

