sion. Every activity is designed to improve how players think, move, and make decisions in the game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',6,16,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-07','$335-$455','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-brookwood-school',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:25:54.929Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:25:56.234Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','a02166c1-b7e6-4b34-ba18-093755fc14b6','nike-soccer-camp-at-brookwood-school-aug-3-7-2026','2026-05-09T20:25:54.929Z','2026-05-09T20:25:54.929Z');

