s a chance to train like the pros, push your game forward, and experience the intensity and excitement of a true academy-style environment. Whether you''re aiming to elevate your game, build a stronger foundation, or simply enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer, this Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect opportunity to take your skills to the next level.',6,16,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$265-$375','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-elkins-park',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:33:44.189Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:33:46.086Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','faff2788-0425-44e6-8711-af8428a4bea4','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-elkins-park-day-camp-june-29-july-3-2026-rotw','2026-05-09T20:33:44.189Z','2026-05-09T20:33:44.189Z');

