erate player growth, build confidence, and inspire a lasting love for the game.',8,18,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-25','$489','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-william-jessup-university',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:33:48.155Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:33:49.921Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','32bdacf2-f4b3-44b5-8dd5-b705eeb681c8','nike-soccer-camp-at-jessup-university-day-camp-june-22-25-2026','2026-05-09T20:33:48.155Z','2026-05-09T20:33:48.155Z');

