 many years to come.” — Aaron Tilsen, Camp Director &amp; Associate Head Women’s Soccer Coach, Minnesota State University‑Mankato Don’t miss your chance to train like a Maverick and take your game to the next level!',6,13,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$275-$365','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-minnesota-state-university-mankato',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:34:01.640Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:34:02.007Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','9ee8764e-1e89-4539-a10b-c40bd291b052','nike-soccer-camp-at-minnesota-state-university-mankato-june-15-18-2026','2026-05-09T20:34:01.640Z','2026-05-09T20:34:01.640Z');

