Charleston campus. With the full Nike Soccer Camp experience, players will not only elevate their skills but also make new friends, grow their love for the game, and create memories that last a lifetime. Hear directly from Coach Cobrin Bowers: "Our camp is a true balance of skill development, learning within the game, and having as much fun as possible. Players will learn a variety of skills, get to apply them in game-like scenarios, and boost their soccer confidence on a daily basis. We want everyone that joins us for camp to feel like they had the best soccer week of the summer and will be itching to come back year after year." Don’t miss your chance to train with championship‑caliber coaches in Charleston, WV, secure your spot today!',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17','$255-$355','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-university-of-charleston-wv',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:34:50.147Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:34:50.469Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','e4f582e4-2825-464e-b752-77e3933923c3','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-charleston-july-13-17-2026-ava6','2026-05-09T20:34:50.147Z','2026-05-09T20:34:50.147Z');

