friends, inspiring coaches, and unforgettable memories, all while taking your game to the next level!',6,16,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$359-$489','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-haverhill-ma',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:36:33.913Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:36:34.202Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','0a315a2d-2603-48c8-91fc-d3b94233c8ca','nike-soccer-camp-in-haverhill-june-29-july-3-2026-ecjv','2026-05-09T20:36:33.913Z','2026-05-09T20:36:33.913Z');

