ents for summer fun and soccer development."',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17','$329-$459','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-mount-saint-vincent',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:36:34.629Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:36:36.229Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','c361d5e4-5e4f-48db-8f22-c25209347f62','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-university-of-mount-saint-vincent-july-13-17-2026','2026-05-09T20:36:34.629Z','2026-05-09T20:36:34.629Z');

