ess, the Nike Boys Soccer Camp at Fairfield University delivers the ultimate summer soccer experience where every player can grow, succeed, and fall in love with the game.',6,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26','$389','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-fairfield-university-connecticut',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','active',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'approved','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:36:41.508Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:36:43.321Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','3e1c3926-5c3e-47e9-9eae-e220bdc58d36','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-fairfield-university-june-22-26-2026-phdn','2026-05-09T20:36:41.508Z','2026-05-09T20:36:41.508Z');

