 inside UDC’s air‑conditioned full‑size arena for lunch, footskill challenges, and exciting small‑sided competitions. Afternoon Splash &amp; Recovery: Recharge with fun, supervised sessions inside the Olympic‑size swimming pool, ideal for recovery, confidence, and summer fun. FIFA World Cup 2026 Big‑Screen Zone: Watch matches, highlights, and unforgettable moments all summer long on our camp big‑screen setup, creating a one‑of‑a‑kind soccer environment. A premier Nike Soccer Camp experience in the Nation’s Capital—trusted, proven, and built for real development! The final TWO weeks of camp in August will take place at the nearby Horace Mann ES, our trusted longtime home that continues to deliver an energetic, community‑driven environment we’re proud to bring into our 2026 programming: Horace Mann ES',5,16,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26','$379-$489','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-foursoccer-washington-dc',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:38:56.842Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:38:58.611Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','76b3aba3-932e-42b8-bf1c-609574d4bda9','nike-soccer-camp-with-foursoccer-washington-dc-day-camp-june-22-26-2026','2026-05-09T20:38:56.842Z','2026-05-09T20:38:56.842Z');

