ke Soccer Camp experience!',10,14,'all','2026-08-11','2026-08-13','$199','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-boys-soccer-camp-notre-dame-high-school-nj',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:39:59.931Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:40:00.237Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','72f06352-9cf1-45d6-b109-6acbe781851b','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-notre-dame-high-school-aug-11-13-2026-t9gp','2026-05-09T20:39:59.931Z','2026-05-09T20:39:59.931Z');

