rocess, competing, learning, and growing in a safe and supportive setting that builds both skill and a lasting love for the game."',6,17,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24','$249-$339','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-stuart-treasure-coast',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:40:16.593Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:40:16.901Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','1ccb894a-3930-4a94-982e-5212b7946c42','nike-soccer-camp-in-stuart-july-20-24-2026','2026-05-09T20:40:16.593Z','2026-05-09T20:40:16.593Z');

