t where every player is seen, supported, and pushed to grow. The environment is led by an influential coaching staff with experience across all levels of the game, including MLS, NWSL, and the U.S. National Team. Regardless of ability level, players are part of a culture that values attention to detail, individual development, and accountability. Every athlete is challenged in the right way, with coaching that balances care, high standards, and a commitment to helping each player reach their potential, on and off the field.”',6,16,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-03','$289-$399','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-presented-by-salsas-11-apex',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:40:23.010Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:40:23.342Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','96a7cd6a-d373-4bee-a64f-03cc69a6550c','nike-soccer-camp-presented-by-salsa-s11-apex-june-29-july-3-2026','2026-05-09T20:40:23.010Z','2026-05-09T20:40:23.010Z');

