X for a week of elite training, positive mentorship, and an authentic Nike Soccer Camp experience, where players can thrive, make new friends, and fuel their love for the game!',6,14,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-05','$255-$355','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-crossbar-academy',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:41:00.666Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:41:02.314Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','3349d637-cf38-44ad-b720-60636bde67ba','nike-soccer-camp-at-crossbar-academy-tomball-june-1-5-2026-35ko','2026-05-09T20:41:00.666Z','2026-05-09T20:41:00.666Z');

