 every single day."',8,18,'all','2026-08-10','2026-08-14','$410','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-ranney-school-tinton-falls',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:41:53.585Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:41:55.268Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','9a25c9e8-52df-47b6-b348-44961a2614a5','nike-soccer-camp-at-ranney-school-tinton-falls-aug-10-14-2026','2026-05-09T20:41:53.585Z','2026-05-09T20:41:53.585Z');

