mer experience filled with skill development, competitive play, new friendships, and the inspiration young athletes need to take their game to the next level.',7,13,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-02','$245-$335','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-university-cincinnati',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:42:41.987Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:42:42.298Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','89880569-a1ba-4f50-8f4b-cd2ba157df30','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-university-of-cincinnati-june-29-july-2-2026','2026-05-09T20:42:41.987Z','2026-05-09T20:42:41.987Z');

