cal ability, game understanding, and confidence on the ball through structured, game-based training. At the same time, we make sure players enjoy the process, competing, learning, and growing in a safe and supportive setting that builds both skill and a lasting love for the game."',6,14,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10','$310-$430','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-elk-grove',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:42:59.318Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:42:59.624Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','563c3728-3dd2-40a9-a0f9-bf0e2437aeb2','nike-soccer-camp-in-elk-grove-july-6-10-2026','2026-05-09T20:42:59.318Z','2026-05-09T20:42:59.318Z');

