unity to continue to progress to a higher level of soccer play. Get the full camp experience and have fun while building the core fundamentals integrated within the French Football Federation. Make friends and create memories with our team that will last a lifetime!',5,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10','$545','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-with-the-french-football-federation-pier-5-brooklyn-bridge',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:45:18.344Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:45:20.196Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','b6adde34-88c5-4b51-b30c-24ae990d4a2c','nike-soccer-camp-with-the-french-football-federation-pier-5-brooklyn-bridge-park','2026-05-09T20:45:18.344Z','2026-05-09T20:45:18.344Z');

