rocess, and excited to compete. Through purposeful training and game-based learning, we help athletes build skill, confidence, and a deeper understanding of the game, while fostering a love for soccer that lasts well beyond camp.”',6,14,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18','$279-$379','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-kalamazoo-college',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:45:33.544Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:45:35.203Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','13b0f056-5beb-4fe8-bec5-09865bdc9a12','nike-soccer-camp-at-kalamazoo-college-june-15-18-2026','2026-05-09T20:45:33.544Z','2026-05-09T20:45:33.544Z');

