d by two of the region’s most respected player‑development leaders. Join us this summer and elevate your game at the Nike Soccer Camp in Murfreesboro!',6,16,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-05','$225-$315','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-murfreesboro-tn',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:45:39.380Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:45:40.811Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','2296b568-c861-4581-9965-ac84e1c57e81','nike-soccer-camp-in-murfreesboro-june-1-5-2026','2026-05-09T20:45:39.380Z','2026-05-09T20:45:39.380Z');

