uided by two of the region’s most respected player‑development leaders. Join us this summer and elevate your game at the Nike Soccer Camp in Murfreesboro!',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31','$225-$315','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-murfreesboro-tn',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T20:49:12.445Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T20:49:14.733Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','e7ca99c7-e6ee-40ee-9693-398168de4b81','nike-soccer-camp-in-murfreesboro-july-27-31-2026','2026-05-09T20:49:12.445Z','2026-05-09T20:49:12.445Z');

