-24','$559-$699','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-purdue-university-collegiate-experience',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:17:13.238Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:17:14.731Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','8a828049-ac9c-4372-abf9-031c5425f210','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-purdue-university-june-21-24-2026','2026-05-09T21:17:13.238Z','2026-05-09T21:17:13.238Z');

