 and motivating environment where players can grow their skills, compete, and develop a lifelong love for the game.',6,13,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19','$275-$385','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-la-salle-university-philadelphia',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:39:19.467Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:39:21.356Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','0ae6bc96-9b35-4c17-85d0-7481f597ba39','nike-soccer-camp-at-la-salle-university-day-camp-i-june-15-19-2026','2026-05-09T21:39:19.467Z','2026-05-09T21:39:19.467Z');

