the Nike Soccer Camp at The Lovett School and take your game to the next level!',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12','$499','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lovett-school',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T21:39:25.231Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T21:39:26.748Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','47a11c48-8592-4e54-99ab-171bb120e617','nike-soccer-camp-at-lovett-school-june-8-12-2026','2026-05-09T21:39:25.231Z','2026-05-09T21:39:25.231Z');

