iate golfers the instruction needed to improve. Half day campers receive three hours of instruction each day with emphasis on putting, chipping, bunker play and full swing. Half Day Camps run Monday through Friday from 9:00am - 12:00pm and are open to beginner/intermediate, ages 6-17. Please note: Lunch is NOT provided for half day campers.',6,17,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10','$489-$879','day',0,0,'open','https://www.ussportscamps.com/golf/nike/nike-golf-camp-rancho-san-joaquin-gc',NULL,NULL,'','','scraped','unverified',50,'ussportscamps.com',NULL,'pending','parentcoachplaybook@gmail.com','2026-05-09T22:17:53.197Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'live','2026-05-09T22:17:53.456Z',200,NULL,NULL,'medium','288386ef-5e45-41ba-a3cb-c8c73642fe12','nike-golf-camp-at-rancho-san-joaquin-golf-course-july-6-10-2026','2026-05-09T22:17:53.197Z','2026-05-09T22:17:53.197Z');

